-- MT2009_PLUS_CUBE_EXCHANGE_ITEM_V1: item 30182 opens the exchange window of NPC 20095
-- (quest seon_pyeong_wymiana) wherever the character stands. Not used up. The server
-- (cube.cpp) sees that the quest item is 30182 and opens the window without the NPC.

quest seon_pyeong_wymiana_item begin
	state start begin
		when 30182.use begin
			command("cube open")
			syschat("Kliknij prawym przyciskiem przedmioty z 1-4 bonusami, potem Akceptuj.")
		end
	end
end
